        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Mau duduk di sini sambil ngerjain tugas?
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Between_Issues_L02
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Boleh.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Between_Issues_L03
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Aku lagi ngerjain bagianku juga.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: DialogueEnd
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: NodeEnd
        Row_Notes: Refresh interaksi; wholeProgress dan friend flags tetap. Mira tidak memiliki dialog sebelum ada issue selesai.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
  - key: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary
    value:
      Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary
      contentRows:
      - Row_Type: NodeStart
        Row_Notes: 'Conditions: $wholeProgress == 1 && $inner_area == 0 && $friend_a_flag != 1 && $friend_b_flag != 1 && $friend_c_flag != 1 && $lastIssue == 2 && $friend_b_flag == 2 && $miraLastIssue != 2.'
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L01
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Tadi kelihatannya kamu masih mau bilang sesuatu.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L02
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Aku nggak suka dipotong. Tapi kalau bilang, takut dibilang sensitif lagi.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L03
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Aku juga pernah takut dianggap berlebihan. Sekarang aku dengerin sampai kamu selesai.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L04
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Aku nggak perlu bikin dia langsung setuju, ya?
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L05
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Kamu bisa mulai dari apa yang kamu butuhkan.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Boundary_L06
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Makasih sudah kasih aku kesempatan buat jelasin.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: DialogueEnd
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: SetVar
        Row_Notes: Issue yang sudah dibahas dengan Mira; friend flag tetap 2.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: miraLastIssue
        Args_2: 2
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: SetVar
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: ally_revealed
        Args_2: 1
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: NodeEnd
        Row_Notes: Refresh interaksi; wholeProgress dan friend flags tetap. Mira tidak memiliki dialog sebelum ada issue selesai.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
  - key: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process
    value:
      Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process
      contentRows:
      - Row_Type: NodeStart
        Row_Notes: 'Conditions: $wholeProgress == 1 && $inner_area == 0 && $friend_a_flag != 1 && $friend_b_flag != 1 && $friend_c_flag != 1 && $lastIssue == 3 && $friend_c_flag == 2 && $miraLastIssue != 3.'
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L01
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Bagian mana dari idemu yang masih pengin kamu pertahankan?
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L02
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Cara ceritanya. Tapi mungkin layout-nya memang terlalu ramai.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L03
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Kamu boleh menyederhanakan layout-nya tanpa membuang semua idemu.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L04
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Tadi rasanya seperti semuanya ditolak.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L05
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Aku ngerti kenapa rasanya berat. Aku dengerin kok.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Help_Process_L06
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Aku mau coba perbaiki layout-nya pelan-pelan.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: DialogueEnd
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: SetVar
        Row_Notes: Issue yang sudah dibahas dengan Mira; friend flag tetap 2.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: miraLastIssue
        Args_2: 3
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: SetVar
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: ally_revealed
        Args_2: 1
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: NodeEnd
        Row_Notes: Refresh interaksi; wholeProgress dan friend flags tetap. Mira tidak memiliki dialog sebelum ada issue selesai.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
  - key: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You
    value:
      Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You
      contentRows:
      - Row_Type: NodeStart
        Row_Notes: 'Conditions: $wholeProgress == 1 && $inner_area == 0 && $friend_a_flag == 2 && $friend_b_flag == 2 && $friend_c_flag == 2 && $miraLastIssue == $lastIssue.'
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You
        Args_1: 
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L01
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Pulang bareng?
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L02
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Iya. Makasih ya, buat hari ini.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L03
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Maksudnya? Aku kan nggak ngapa-ngapain yang membantu.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L04
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Kamu dengerin aku.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L05
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Kamu nggak langsung menganggap aku masalah.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L06
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Aku merasa kamu lihat aku sebagai orang. Bukan sesuatu yang harus dibenerin.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L07
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Buat aku, itu sudah banyak banget.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L08
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Oh...
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Wait
        Row_Notes: Jeda memberi ruang.
        Row_Id: 
        Args_1: 1
        Args_2: 
        Args_3: 
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L09
        Args_1: Mira
        Args_2: Kalau begitu, besok cerita lagi aja.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
        Row_Notes: 
        Row_Id: OI_School_Mira_Walk_Home_Thank_You_L10
        Args_1: '[PlayerName]'
        Args_2: Iya. Sampai besok.
        Args_3: neutral
        Args_4: 
        Args_5: 
      - Row_Type: Dialogue
